1
00:00:00,074 --> 00:00:01,148
Welcome.

2
00:00:02,259 --> 00:00:04,975
And thank you for
taking part in this study.

3
00:00:06,391 --> 00:00:10,132
Today you'll take part in a
full-body illusion experiment.

4
00:00:11,106 --> 00:00:13,968
It explores how we
experience our own body and

5
00:00:14,585 --> 00:00:17,436
our sense of where
we are located in space.

6
00:00:19,082 --> 00:00:21,152
The session has three parts.

7
00:00:21,931 --> 00:00:23,847
First, a short task.

8
00:00:25,129 --> 00:00:29,570
Then, a guided meditation
experience in virtual reality.

9
00:00:30,512 --> 00:00:34,125
And finally, the same task once more.

10
00:00:35,597 --> 00:00:38,638
Altogether, this will take
around thirty minutes.

11
00:00:40,279 --> 00:00:44,481
Before we begin, please find
a comfortable seated position.

12
00:00:45,737 --> 00:00:47,176
Keep your back straight

13
00:00:47,938 --> 00:00:50,657
and let your hands rest gently in your lap.

14
00:00:52,048 --> 00:00:56,078
You'll be wearing a virtual reality
headset for most of the session,

15
00:00:56,390 --> 00:01:01,648
so take a moment now to make sure
your position feels stable and relaxed.

16
00:01:03,382 --> 00:01:04,944
Now let’s begin

